03. No such node: 404
=====================
404
{
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/ResourceNotFound",
  "title": "Not Found",
  "status": 404,
  "detail": "bridge 'opcua': the OPC UA server has no node 'ns=2;s=Nope' (BadNodeIdUnknown)"
}



04. The server dies while the bridge reads: 503 - the node is not said to be missing
======================================================================================
503
{
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/InternalError",
  "title": "Service Unavailable",
  "status": 503,
  "detail": "bridge 'opcua': the OPC UA server did not answer the read of 'ns=2;s=Press17' REGEX(\((BadSecureChannelClosed|BadConnectionClosed)\))"
}



05. No server - the bridge cannot reconnect: 503, and why, within 5 s
====================================================================
503
{
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/InternalError",
  "title": "Service Unavailable",
  "status": 503,
  "detail": "bridge 'opcua': the OPC UA server opc.tcp://localhost:14840 cannot be reached (BadConnectionRejected)"
}



